CORE
nondet_outer.c
--unwind 3 --unwinding-assertions --paths lifo
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
On the second outer iteration the guard at "goto inner" is not true, so the
unconditional-goto fast path is taken only because of path exploration. The
inner loop's unwinding counter must still be reset on entry.
